  "notes": "Current page lists 2025年度〜2026年度第1四半期; older quarters are on https://www.mhi.com/jp/finance/library/result_archive. MHI labels periods by 年度 (fiscal year START), e.g. '2026年度第1四半期' = 2027年3月期 Q1 (fy 2027); URL folder fyYYYYnq uses the 年度 start year. Tanshin titles and dates taken from the tanshin cover (IR page shows only '決算短信' and a date only for the newest quarter); presentation date = same-day release. IFRS throughout. Presentation = '決算説明資料' (presentation.pdf); a variant '決算説明資料（説明要旨付き）' (presentation_summary.pdf) and Q&A summaries also exist and were not recorded. 2026年度第2四半期 (fy2027 q2) not yet published as of 2026-10-27 (MHI usually reports early November). 13 quarters recorded: fy2024 q1 – fy2027 q1. Note: the IR page says the web version of the 2024年3月期 決算短信 (fy2024 q4) had an error between 2024-05-08 and 2024-05-10 that was corrected (TDnet version was correct); the currently hosted file is the corrected one."
